diabetes_bloodwork_2024_q3.text:
diabetes bloodwork 2024 q3: Fasting blood glucose: 135 mg/dL; A1C: 6.9%; Morning readings: 125-130 mg/dL; Recommendations: Increase dietary fiber, add light exercise after meals;

Cholesterol results: Total cholesterol: 195 mg/dL (acceptable); LDL: 130 mg/dL (above target <100 mg/dL); HDL: 58 mg/dL (good range); Triglycerides: 140 mg/dL (slightly elevated);

Doctor’s recommendations: Increase intake of healthy fats (avocados, nuts); reduce saturated fats;

Blood pressure: 138/85 mmHg (last check-up); Target: <130/80 mmHg; Home readings: 135–140 systolic, 80–90 diastolic; Influenced by stress and salt intake; Actions: Reducing sodium, increasing water intake — showing improvement;

Vitamin D: Level: 22 ng/mL (deficient; normal range: 30-50 ng/mL); Treatment: Starting 2,000 IU daily supplement; Follow-up: Retest in 3 months.
